  "releaseNotes": "- Initial release of Supabase OASIS provider.\n- Uses Supabase PostgREST REST API — no Supabase SDK dependency.\n- Tables: oasis_avatars, oasis_avatar_details, oasis_holons (create via Supabase SQL editor).\n- Supports anon key and service role key authentication.",
